{# Фіча 004: «Крістал: головна». Автоекранування в OpenCart вимкнене — значення (декодовані в контролері) виводимо через |e. #}
{{ header }}{{ column_left }}
<div id="content">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container-fluid">
      <div class="pull-right">
        <button type="submit" form="form-kristal-home" data-toggle="tooltip" title="{{ button_save }}" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa fa-save"></i></button>
        <a href="{{ cancel }}" data-toggle="tooltip" title="{{ button_cancel }}" class="btn btn-default"><i class="fa fa-reply"></i></a></div>
      <h1>{{ heading_title }}</h1>
      <ul class="breadcrumb">
        {% for breadcrumb in breadcrumbs %}
        <li><a href="{{ breadcrumb.href }}">{{ breadcrumb.text }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container-fluid">
    {% if error_warning %}
    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible"><i class="fa fa-exclamation-circle"></i> {{ error_warning }}
      <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="alert">&times;</button>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if success %}
    <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible"><i class="fa fa-check-circle"></i> {{ success }}
      <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="alert">&times;</button>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="alert alert-info"><i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i> {{ text_note }}</div>
    <div class="panel panel-default">
      <div class="panel-heading">
        <h3 class="panel-title"><i class="fa fa-pencil"></i> {{ text_edit }}</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="panel-body">
        <form action="{{ action }}" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" id="form-kristal-home" class="form-horizontal">
          <ul class="nav nav-tabs">
            <li class="active"><a href="#tab-main" data-toggle="tab">{{ tab_main }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tab-numbers" data-toggle="tab">{{ tab_numbers }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tab-faq" data-toggle="tab">{{ tab_faq }}</a></li>
            <li><a href="#tab-text" data-toggle="tab">{{ tab_text }}</a></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="tab-content">
            <div class="tab-pane active" id="tab-main">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-status">{{ entry_status }}</label>
                <div class="col-sm-10">
                  <select name="status" id="input-status" class="form-control">
                    <option value="1"{% if status %} selected="selected"{% endif %}>{{ text_enabled }}</option>
                    <option value="0"{% if not status %} selected="selected"{% endif %}>{{ text_disabled }}</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-h1">{{ entry_h1 }}</label>
                <div class="col-sm-10"><input type="text" name="h1" value="{{ h1|e }}" id="input-h1" class="form-control" maxlength="160"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-lead">{{ entry_lead }}</label>
                <div class="col-sm-10"><textarea name="lead" rows="3" id="input-lead" class="form-control" maxlength="400">{{ lead|e }}</textarea></div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-group{% if error.hero_image %} has-error{% endif %}">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label"><span data-toggle="tooltip" title="{{ help_hero_image|e }}">{{ entry_hero_image }}</span></label>
                <div class="col-sm-10">
                  <a href="" id="thumb-image" data-toggle="image" class="img-thumbnail"><img src="{{ thumb }}" alt="" title="" data-placeholder="{{ placeholder }}"></a>
                  <input type="hidden" name="hero_image" value="{{ hero_image|e }}" id="input-image">
                  {% if error.hero_image %}<div class="text-danger">{{ error.hero_image }}</div>{% endif %}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-meta-title"><span data-toggle="tooltip" title="{{ help_meta_title|e }}">{{ entry_meta_title }}</span></label>
                <div class="col-sm-10">
                  <input type="text" name="meta_title" value="{{ meta_title|e }}" id="input-meta-title" class="form-control" maxlength="120" data-k-count="60">
                  <p class="help-block"><span data-k-counter="input-meta-title">0</span> / 60 {{ text_chars }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-meta-description"><span data-toggle="tooltip" title="{{ help_meta_description|e }}">{{ entry_meta_description }}</span></label>
                <div class="col-sm-10">
                  <textarea name="meta_description" rows="3" id="input-meta-description" class="form-control" maxlength="300" data-k-count="160">{{ meta_description|e }}</textarea>
                  <p class="help-block"><span data-k-counter="input-meta-description">0</span> / 160 {{ text_chars }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-numbers">
              {% for n in numbers %}
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-number-{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ entry_number_value }} {{ loop.index }}</label>
                <div class="col-sm-3"><input type="text" name="numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}][value]" value="{{ n.value|e }}" id="input-number-{{ loop.index0 }}" class="form-control" maxlength="16" placeholder="5000+"></div>
                <div class="col-sm-7"><input type="text" name="numbers[{{ loop.index0 }}][label]" value="{{ n.label|e }}" class="form-control" maxlength="64" placeholder="{{ entry_number_label }}" aria-label="{{ entry_number_label }} {{ loop.index }}"></div>
              </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-faq">
              {% for item in faq %}
              <fieldset>
                <legend>{{ entry_question }} {{ loop.index }}</legend>
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-faq-q-{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ entry_question }}</label>
                  <div class="col-sm-10"><input type="text" name="faq[{{ loop.index0 }}][q]" value="{{ item.q|e }}" id="input-faq-q-{{ loop.index0 }}" class="form-control" maxlength="200"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                  <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-faq-a-{{ loop.index0 }}">{{ entry_answer }}</label>
                  <div class="col-sm-10"><textarea name="faq[{{ loop.index0 }}][a]" rows="3" id="input-faq-a-{{ loop.index0 }}" class="form-control" maxlength="1000">{{ item.a|e }}</textarea></div>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane" id="tab-text">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="col-sm-2 control-label" for="input-seo-text">{{ entry_seo_text }}</label>
                <div class="col-sm-10"><textarea name="seo_text" id="input-seo-text" data-toggle="summernote" data-lang="{{ summernote }}" class="form-control">{{ seo_text|e }}</textarea></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="view/javascript/summernote/summernote.min.js"></script>
<link href="view/javascript/summernote/summernote.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="view/javascript/summernote/summernote-image-attributes.js"></script>
<script src="view/javascript/summernote/opencart.js"></script>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll('[data-k-count]').forEach(function (field) {
  var out = document.querySelector('[data-k-counter="' + field.id + '"]'), max = +field.getAttribute('data-k-count');
  var upd = function () { out.textContent = field.value.length; out.parentNode.classList.toggle('text-danger', field.value.length > max); };
  field.addEventListener('input', upd); upd();
});
</script>
{{ footer }}
